Package: p3-fancurve
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Erik Gonzalez <dev@gonzalezerik.com>
Depends: python3, acpi-call-dkms
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/gonzalezerik/p3-tiny-fancurve
Description: Fan curve for the Lenovo ThinkStation P3 Tiny Gen 2
 Switches the embedded controller between its quiet curve and full speed
 based on CPU package temperature, using the firmware's runtime cooling-mode
 WMI method, and reads fan RPM from EC RAM. Fails safe to full speed.
